kzhento-installer-prompt (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Declare Replaces/Breaks against kubuntu-installer-prompt so the
    renamed package can take over /usr/bin/kubuntu-installer-prompt
    without a dpkg file-conflict error (Closes: #6).
  * Install the executable as /usr/bin/kzhento-installer-prompt so the
    package ships a command matching its name (Closes: #8). Keep the old
    /usr/bin/kubuntu-installer-prompt as a compatibility symlink for
    existing ISO integrations, and have start-kubuntu-live-env launch the
    new command.

